//@version=5
indicator("request/security")
// request.security with no host provider resamples the chart's own bars. This
// fixture's data is minute-spaced (see `// Data:`), so "5" aggregates every 5
// bars into one 5-minute bar. A bar is only visible once its last minute closes
// (non-repainting), so the value is na until the first 5-minute bar confirms,
// then steps each time a new one does.
//
// close is 102..116; the 5-minute bars confirm on bars 4 (close 106),
// 9 (close 111) and 14 (close 116).

// Bars: 15
// Data: request_bars.csv

htf = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "5", close)
log.info(str.tostring(htf))

// Expected output:
// NaN
// NaN
// NaN
// NaN
// 106
// 106
// 106
// 106
// 106
// 111
// 111
// 111
// 111
// 111
// 116
